Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Name the departures from parity, and scope the rule

The section now names the upstream commit it compares against, asks for
isequal rather than ==, says what a diagnostic being off means, scopes the
with-a-diagnostic clause to the default solver, and lists the two known
departures on main with their state.

